  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1189855.svg\" alt=\"title\" width=\"169\" height=\"25\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/NeoForge-lime?style=plastic&link=https://neoforged.net/\" alt=\"Static Badge\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Этот мод добавляет множество новых типов резцов в <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisel-modern\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chisel Modern</a> с некоторыми уникальными функциями<br><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Этот проект сильно вдохновлён </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/morechisels\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">MoreChisels</span></a><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/ExtraChisels/screen/all.png?raw=true\" width=\"752\" height=\"453\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/ExtraChisels/screen/energy.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"407\" height=\"225\"></p>",
